          "skill": "boundaries",
          "passage": "Bioarchaeologist Kristina Killgrove, a faculty member at the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill, uses strontium isotope analysis on Roman skeletal remains to test long-standing claims about migration into Imperial _______ reconstructions of ancient diets, especially among the urban poor; and assessments of mortality patterns in working-class cemeteries outside the city walls.",
